==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|Quicunque Vult|Quicumque vult}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|EL.|[[quīcunque]] [[vult]]}} (''salvus esse …'') (“whoever will (be saved …)”), the opening words of the creed.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|def=1|nolinkhead=1}}

# {{lb|en|Christianity}} The [[w:Athanasian Creed|Athanasian Creed]].
#: {{syn|en|Quicunque}}
